{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19804","headline":"婵娟篇 · 孟郊","name":"婵娟篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花婵娟，泛春泉。\n竹婵娟，笼晓烟。\n妓婵娟，不长妍。\n月婵娟，真可怜。\n夜半姮娥朝太一，人间本自无灵匹。\n汉宫承宠不多时，飞燕婕妤相妬嫉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}